/div><p style="text-align: left;">Regarding the ideas and linguistic aspects of the previous text, judge the following item.</p><p style="text-align: left;">The phrase “industry-leading firms” (in red) could appropriately be replaced with <em>leading industrial companies</em>, as both convey equivalent meanings.</p>', 'judge the following item. The phrase “industry-leading firms” (in red) could appropriately be replaced with leading industrial companies , as both convey equivalent meanings.', true, '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', 'ERRADO', '', false);
