free?</strong>.Internet: &lt;www.hawaii.edu&gt; (adapted).</em></span></p></div><p style="text-align: left;">Judge the following item concerning the ideas and linguistic features of the previous text.</p><p style="text-align: left;">The expression “Broadly speaking” indicates that what follows is a general take on the subject, without considering exceptions or specificities.</p>', 'Judge the following item concerning the ideas and linguistic features of the previous text. The expression “Broadly speaking” indicates that what follows is a general take on the subject, without considering exceptions or specificities.', true, '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', 'CERTO', '', false);
