	The idiom “Across the pond”  could be replaced by<strong> Overseas</strong>, without altering the meaning of the sentence.</p>', 'decide whether the', true, '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', 'ERRADO', '', false);
