uggested in item grammatically correct and maintains the meaning of the original text. “I was already confused because in India the teachers switch classes according to periods” = Eu ainda estava confuso porque na Índia os professores trocam de salas de acordo com os períodos.', true, '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', '2026-01-30 18:26:23.6685', 'ERRADO', '', false);
