INSERT INTO public.questao VALUES (39936, 2007, 4087, '1290471', NULL, 'CEBRASPE', '<p>Considerando que as proposições lógicas sejam representadas por letras maiúsculas e utilizando os conectivos lógicos usuais, julgue o item a seguir a respeito de lógica proposicional.</p><p>A sentença “Somente por meio da educação, o homem pode crescer, amadurecer e desenvolver um sentimento de cidadania” pode ser simbolicamente representada pela expressão lógica <span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 5.211em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 4.653em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.367em, 1004.65em, 2.607em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">P<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.127em;"></span></span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">∧</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.251em;">Q</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">∧</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.251em;">R</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.274em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.115em;"></span></span><span>P∧Q∧R</span></span></span>, em que <span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 0.871em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.747em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.367em, 1000.75em, 2.421em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">P<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.127em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.066em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.906em;"></span></span><span>P</span></span></span>, <span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 0.933em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.809em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.367em, 1000.75em, 2.607em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">Q</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.274em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.115em;"></span></span><span>Q</span></span></span> e <span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 0.871em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.747em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.367em, 1000.75em, 2.421em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">R</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.066em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.906em;"></span></span><span>R</span></span></span> são proposições adequadamente escolhidas.</p>', 'julgue o item a seguir a respeito de lógica proposicional.
