="position: relative;"><span style="width: 1.119em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.995em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.553em, 1000.93em, 2.421em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">→</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.066em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.698em;"></span></span><span>→</span></span></span>Q)<span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 0.809em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.685em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.429em, 1000.62em, 2.421em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">∨</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.066em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.837em;"></span></span><span>∨</span></span></span>R apresenta valores V ou F na seguinte sequência, de cima para baixo: V F F F V V V V.</p>', 'julgue o item seguinte.
