INSERT INTO public.questao VALUES (40087, 2007, 4091, '156999', NULL, 'CEBRASPE', '<p>Considerando que P e Q representem proposições conhecidas e que V e F representem, respectivamente, os valores verdadeiro e falso, julgue o próximo item.</p><p>A proposição [P<span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 0.809em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.685em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.429em, 1000.62em, 2.421em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">∨</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.066em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.837em;"></span></span><span>∨</span></span></span>Q] <span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 1.119em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.995em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.553em, 1000.93em, 2.421em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">→</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.066em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.698em;"></span></span><span>→</span></span></span> Q é uma tautologia.</p>', 'julgue o próximo item.
