ine-block; overflow: hidden;"></span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">∨</span><span style="height: 0em; vertical-align: 0em; width: 0.189em; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden;"></span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.251em;">q<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">→</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.251em;">r</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.235em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.274em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.045em;"></span></span><span>p∨q→r</span></span></span> é equivalente a <span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); display: none;"></span><span style="position: relative;"><span style="width: 8.498em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 7.568em; height: 0px; font-size: 112%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.305em, 1007.44em, 2.669em, -999.997em); top: -2.229em; left: 0em;"><span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">(</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">p</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">→</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.251em;">r</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">)</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">∨</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">(</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">q<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.251em;">→</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.251em;">r</span><span style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">)</s